1
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:01,359
Damn, Sun Ming.

2
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,840
That bastard Li Wen dared to set me up.

3
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:26,719
I'll kill you!

4
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,520
He even dyed it back to blonde hair.

5
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,759
Dandan

6
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:43,759
Brother Liu

7
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,400
Brother Liu

8
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,120
When will you pay the wages you owe me?

9
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:48,280
I haven't eaten for days.

10
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:48,560
Brother Liu

11
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,599
You stink so bad!

12
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,599
Let go of me first.

13
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:51,479
I'll wire it to you later.

14
00:02:51,879 --> 00:02:52,479
Let go!

15
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:53,639
Brother Liu

16
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,000
Bro.

17
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,039
Bro, bro.

18
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:20,639
Come here.

19
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:26,000
Bro, can you do me a favor?

20
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,599
Sure.

21
00:03:26,599 --> 00:03:27,680
Bring me that phone.

22
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:32,680
Thanks.

23
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,719
What's going on?

24
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,159
I just got the phone.

25
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,439
Bro Liu tied me up here.

26
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,639
I'm trapped here and can't get out.

27
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,280
Bro Liu still hasn't shown up.

28
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,919
Could something have gone wrong?

29
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:58,479
Hard to say.

30
00:03:59,080 --> 00:03:59,719
Tell you what.

31
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,439
We're coming to rescue you right now.

32
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,319
I'll go.

33
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,639
Let's go.

34
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:14,439
How did you get in here?

35
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:17,319
Bro Liu tricked me into coming here.

36
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,040
Same as me.

37
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:22,000
Bro, can you untie me?

38
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:25,120
I haven't eaten for days. I'm starving.

39
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:28,560
Look, I have money in my pocket. Take it.

40
00:04:37,079 --> 00:04:38,360
Just leave enough for me to eat.

41
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,680
Try running now!

42
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,360
Take it easy!

43
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:52,240
I'll just give you the money!

44
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,480
And you said you hadn't eaten!

45
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,480
How are you this strong?

46
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,480
Bro Dan!

47
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,519
Boss Dan!

48
00:05:00,519 --> 00:05:01,360
I'll give you money!

49
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:03,000
Take that!

50
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:08,240
Playing dirty with me!

51
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:12,120
Bro Dan!

52
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,439
Bro Dan

53
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,199
Where the hell have you been?

54
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:42,000
Brother Liu

55
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,600
Brother Liu

56
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,759
Are you okay, Brother Liu?

57
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:48,439
Nobody move!

58
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,160
Get down!

59
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,959
Hands on your heads and get down!

60
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:55,000
What took you so long?

61
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:02,800
Six.

62
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,079
Seven.

63
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:04,879
Eight.

64
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:05,959
Nine.

65
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:06,600
Where's number ten?

66
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,720
Number ten is Li Wen.

67
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:09,759
He's at the company.

68
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:10,800
Officer.

69
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,519
Does this earn me credit?

70
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:13,959
Bro Liu.

71
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:16,000
We already have conclusive evidence.

72
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:17,079
Officer.

73
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,680
I won't resist stubbornly.

74
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,600
I'll talk.

75
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,399
You know the drill.

76
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:23,199
Start talking.

77
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:26,160
Our boss is Grass Snake.

78
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:31,519
I mean, the guy in charge is Grass Snake.

79
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,680
I only took over after he disappeared.

80
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,759
I got promoted, you know.

81
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:38,120
Our big boss is a psychology expert.

82
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:40,000
His real name is Yan Li.

83
00:06:41,879 --> 00:06:42,680
Officer.

84
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:44,399
Can I redeem myself through good deeds?

85
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,680
You have to help me get leniency.

86
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,519
Please make it happen.

87
00:06:58,079 --> 00:06:59,560
Search every corner carefully.

88
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:01,120
Don't overlook any details.

89
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:01,959
Understood?

90
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,879
Understood.

91
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:03,560
Move out!

92
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,360
He's a visiting psychology teacher here.

93
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,560
He comes to the school once a week

94
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,279
to give students psychological counseling.

95
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,720
That's the general situation.

96
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:31,920
Understood.

97
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,079
Thank you for your cooperation.

98
00:07:33,079 --> 00:07:33,759
You're welcome.

99
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,680
Goodbye.

100
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:39,199
Let's go.

101
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:47,639
Captain Sun, Yan Li's addresses are empty.

102
00:07:48,399 --> 00:07:49,120
In that case,

103
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,720
have the traffic department assist us.

104
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,800
Strictly screen all entrances and exits.

105
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,560
Yes, sir.

106
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,600
How does Yan Li always know in advance?

107
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,240
Yan Li has an informant in the city.

108
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,120
I'll send someone to investigate.

109
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:09,279
We have to root him out.

110
00:08:10,079 --> 00:08:12,079
Get Yan Li's contact info from Bro Liu.

111
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:13,399
I'll go find Yan Li.

112
00:08:13,519 --> 00:08:15,360
No, doing that is too dangerous.

113
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,360
You'll be easily exposed.

114
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,480
Yan Li hasn't secured his footing yet.

115
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,519
He definitely needs manpower.

116
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,800
If we don't contact him now,

117
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,720
he might cut off all contact at any time.

118
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,399
Can you stop hesitating?

119
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,759
We're very close to the border here.

120
00:08:26,759 --> 00:08:28,079
He could escape at any moment.

121
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:29,759
I will handle it.

122
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,559
How much longer will it take?

123
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:41,360
Our funds are being transferred.

124
00:08:41,879 --> 00:08:43,399
We still have many business lines to cut.

125
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:44,879
It will probably take another

126
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:45,559
three days.

127
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:49,000
Remember to destroy the evidence.

128
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,320
Yes, Sir.

129
00:08:57,279 --> 00:08:58,720
Probably one of Grass Snake's men.

130
00:08:59,080 --> 00:08:59,799
Named Li Wen.

131
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:04,759
Hello?

132
00:09:05,159 --> 00:09:05,960
Hello, Boss.

133
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,000
I'm Li Wen.

134
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:09,279
The Technical Team Leader of the company.

135
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:11,480
How...

136
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,399
How did you not get caught?

137
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,799
I'm just a nobody.

138
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,399
Got locked up for a few days and released.

139
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:17,879
Very good.

140
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,759
I need talent like you.

141
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,600
I'll send someone to pick you up.

142
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:22,879
Thank you, Boss.

143
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:41,840
Go to the city

144
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:45,480
and keep monitoring the police movements.

145
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,200
Then send someone to bring Li Wen here.

146
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,000
Li Wen.

147
00:09:56,879 --> 00:09:58,159
Grass Snake is gone.

148
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,360
Bro Liu was caught.

149
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:02,120
Yet you still managed to find me.

150
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,320
Interesting.

151
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:49,080
Boss.

152
00:10:51,679 --> 00:10:52,840
Call me Sir.

153
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,519
Sir.

154
00:11:04,279 --> 00:11:05,519
You're a programmer.

155
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,679
I'm quite skilled.

156
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:12,240
You'll need me.

157
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:13,639
Bro Liu and Grass Snake

158
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,000
are both gone.

159
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:16,879
Yet you're completely fine.

160
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,080
You're quite lucky.

161
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,399
Sir.

162
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,919
Ever since I joined the organization,

163
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,519
I haven't made any money.

164
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,480
I've been to the detention center twice.

165
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,720
I can't even go back to my job now.

166
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,639
I hope you'll take me in, Sir.

167
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:34,240
Don't worry.

168
00:11:35,799 --> 00:11:37,080
Seeing how loyal you are,

169
00:11:37,919 --> 00:11:39,519
how could I bear to let you leave?

170
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:43,799
Thank you, Sir.

171
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:51,840
Do you know her?

172
00:12:04,279 --> 00:12:06,200
I specialize in psychology.

173
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,279
It appears to me you

174
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,759
are more than acquaintances with her.

175
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:13,720
Sir.

176
00:12:15,279 --> 00:12:16,759
I don't know what you're talking about.

177
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,279
Since you dared to show up,

178
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,399
I cannot be lacking in courtesy.

179
00:12:22,039 --> 00:12:23,080
Now,

180
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:25,159
I will entertain you properly.

181
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,120
Speak.

182
00:13:26,039 --> 00:13:27,080
Who the hell are you?

183
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:30,480
Who are you to her?

184
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:33,759
I don't know what you're talking about.

185
00:13:35,279 --> 00:13:36,480
I just acted on a whim,

186
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,399
using Sun Yao's photo

187
00:13:38,519 --> 00:13:39,639
to test you.

188
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,440
It was your expression

189
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,799
that gave you away.

190
00:13:45,559 --> 00:13:46,600
Sir.

191
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,799
I just wanted to make some money.

192
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,279
Still playing tough.

193
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,480
Beat him up.

194
00:14:08,279 --> 00:14:09,639
If I'm not mistaken,

195
00:14:10,919 --> 00:14:11,679
you must be

196
00:14:11,679 --> 00:14:12,720
the man she wanted to marry.

197
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:13,480
Is that right?

198
00:14:17,879 --> 00:14:18,679
Sun Yao...

199
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:23,399
You killed her.
